    <node id="FutureWork:We shall, therefore, perform our experiments on datasets that satisfy the following criteria: – Domain-wise, the dataset should consist of images of printed (or typewritten) text, which are partitioned into sub-collections of pictures from the same or similar printing sources. – Granularity-wise, the data and their annotation should allow for a straightforward evaluation process.">
      <data key="d0">FutureWork</data>
      <data key="d1">We shall, therefore, perform our experiments on datasets that satisfy the following criteria: – Domain-wise, the dataset should consist of images of printed (or typewritten) text, which are partitioned into sub-collections of pictures from the same or similar printing sources. – Granularity-wise, the data and their annotation should allow for a straightforward evaluation process.</data>
      <data key="d2">{}</data>
    </node>
