    <node id="FutureWork:The resulting ρ-values – 0.29 for NER, 0.56 for POS tagging, and 0.81 for UD parsing – suggest that this set of factors is meaningful for some tasks, though additional and more ﬁne-grained analysis in future work should give a more complete explanation.">
      <data key="d0">FutureWork</data>
      <data key="d1">The resulting ρ-values – 0.29 for NER, 0.56 for POS tagging, and 0.81 for UD parsing – suggest that this set of factors is meaningful for some tasks, though additional and more ﬁne-grained analysis in future work should give a more complete explanation.</data>
